01:02:54.341 --> 01:02:56.376
♪ ♪

885
01:03:24.438 --> 01:03:26.473
♪ ♪

886
01:03:37.417 --> 01:03:38.585
- [inima bate]
- [focuri de armă]

887
01:03:38.586 --> 01:03:42.119
[rachetă whooshes]
